"or prefixes:"

#: inc/functions/ai/tools.php:173
msgid ""
"请总结下面文章的主要内容，要求适用于页面的meta description标签，长度在100字以"
"内，使用与文章内容相同的语言，直接陈述文章内容，不要换行、不要引号、不要 "
"markdown、不要任何解释，只输出总结内容本身。："
msgstr ""
"Please summarize the main content of the article below, suitable for the "
"page's meta description tag, within 100 characters, using the same language "
"as the article content, directly stating the article content, no line "
"breaks, no quotes, no markdown, no explanations, only output the summary "
"content itself.:"

#: inc/functions/ai/tools.php:175
msgid ""
"你是一位专业的SEO编辑，输出简洁、准确、可直接用于 meta description 的纯文本。"
msgstr ""
"You are a professional SEO editor. Output concise, accurate plain tex"
"t that can be used directly as a meta description."

#: inc/functions/ai/tools.php:191
msgid ""
"为下面的内容拟一个标题，要求使用与内容相同的语言，概括准确、长度在 30 字以"
"内，不要换行、不要引号、不要 markdown、不要任何解释或前缀，只输出标题本身："
msgstr ""
"Write a title for the following content. Use the same language as the"
" content, summarize it accurately, keep it within 30 characters, no l"
"ine breaks, no quotation marks, no markdown, no explanation or prefix"
". Output only the title itself:"

#: inc/functions/ai/tools.php:193
msgid "你是一位专业的编辑，输出的标题简洁、准确，不使用夸张的标题党措辞。"
msgstr ""
"You are a professional editor, the output titles are concise, accurate, and "
"do not use sensationalist clickbait phrases."

